OL,3,GNEWSA'I've changed to a hybrid car' -
OL,4,ADrivers' fears as fuel prices soar
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs the price of diesel hits more than
OL,7,F#2 per litre at some of Northern
OL,8,FIreland's forecourts and with petrol
OL,9,Fprices also soaring, motorists have
OL,10,Fbeen telling BBC News NI how it is
OL,11,Fchanging their driving habits.
OL,13,FThe ongoing conflict in the Middle East
OL,14,Fhas caused disruption around critical
OL,15,Fshipping lanes like the Strait of
OL,16,FHormuz, causing the price of wholesale
OL,17,Ffuel to continue to rise.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
