OL,3,GNEWSA'I've changed to a hybrid car' -
OL,4,ADrivers' fears as fuel prices soar
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs prices at the pumps reach a four
OL,7,Fyear high, the NI Consumer Council said
OL,8,Fconsumers were being
OL,9,F"disproportionately" affected as there
OL,10,Fwere more diesel drivers and a more
OL,11,Frural population.
OL,13,FIt said last week petrol prices were at
OL,14,Ftheir highest level since September
OL,15,F2022 following Russia's invasion of
OL,16,FUkraine earlier that year and that
OL,17,Fdiesel prices were "heading that way
OL,18,Ftoo".
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
